{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgiCLdQZyDu4XgKDefYen","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UdQJtBUf8isyrMRQ9Wwa1p","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>","content":"POS_A = [  # card payment, bad/wrong exchange rate (direction set)\n    \"The exchange rate on my card payment was wrong.\",\n    \"I paid with my card abroad and the rate you used was terrible.\",\n    \"Why was I given such a bad exchange rate for my purchase?\",\n    \"The currency conversion on my last card payment looks off.\",\n    \"I bought something in euros and the amount charged in pounds is too high, the rate must be wrong.\",\n    \"The rate applied to my card transaction is not the official rate.\",\n    \"You converted my payment at the wrong exchange rate.\",\n    \"My purchase in dollars was converted incorrectly.\",\n    \"The amount on my statement for a foreign purchase is wrong because of the exchange rate.\",\n    \"Which exchange rate did you use for my card payment? It looks wrong.\",\n    \"I think I was overcharged because of a bad conversion rate when I paid at a shop overseas.\",\n    \"The exchange rate for my online purchase in another currency is incorrect.\",\n    \"The conversion rate on a payment I made in Spain is way off.\",\n    \"Paid at a restaurant abroad and the exchange rate is much worse than expected.\",\n    \"Why did my card payment use a different exchange rate than the one shown online?\",\n    \"The amount looks wrong for my card payment in yen, the rate is not right.\",\n    \"I was charged more than I should have been for an overseas purchase, the rate was wrong.\",\n    \"Your exchange rate for my hotel payment is not correct.\",\n    \"The rate you applied to my card purchase is worse than the market rate.\",\n    \"My foreign card payment was converted at a bad rate.\",\n]\nPOS_B = [  # cash withdrawal, bad/wrong exchange rate (direction set)\n    \"The exchange rate for my ATM withdrawal was wrong.\",\n    \"I took out cash abroad and got a terrible exchange rate.\",\n    \"The rate used for my cash withdrawal is incorrect.\",\n    \"I withdrew euros from an ATM and was charged too much because of the rate.\",\n    \"Why was my cash withdrawal converted at such a bad rate?\",\n    \"The exchange rate on my withdrawal is not the real rate.\",\n    \"I got cash in another country and the amount taken from my account looks wrong, the rate is off.\",\n    \"The ATM withdrawal abroad used the wrong currency rate.\",\n    \"Wrong exchange rate applied when I took money out at a cash machine.\",\n    \"The conversion on the cash I withdrew in Thailand is way off.\",\n    \"My withdrawal in dollars cost me more than it should, the exchange rate seems wrong.\",\n    \"The rate for taking out cash overseas was much worse than expected.\",\n    \"Which rate did you use when I withdrew cash? It is not correct.\",\n    \"I think the exchange rate on my ATM cash was incorrect.\",\n    \"The amount deducted for my foreign cash withdrawal is wrong due to the rate.\",\n    \"I withdrew local currency and the rate applied was bad.\",\n    \"Cash withdrawal abroad had a poor exchange rate, why?\",\n    \"The rate on my cash machine withdrawal in Mexico was wrong.\",\n    \"The amount for my cash withdrawal looks wrong, the exchange rate is not right.\",\n    \"I took out cash on holiday and was given the wrong exchange rate.\",\n]\nPOS_TEST = [  # held out, not used for direction\n    \"Why is the rate on my card purchase in France so bad?\",\n    \"There is an error with the exchange rate on something I paid for abroad.\",\n    \"I bought a jacket online in dollars and the converted amount is wrong.\",\n    \"The exchange rate I got at the ATM in Italy was wrong.\",\n    \"When I withdrew cash in Poland, the rate was way too high.\",\n    \"My card payment abroad has an incorrect currency conversion.\",\n    \"I got less value than expected wh