e\",\n    \"bad exchange rate on my purchase\",\n    \"exchange rate for my card payment is incorrect\",\n    \"I'm unhappy with the exchange rate on my card transaction\",\n    \"Why did you use an incorrect rate for my payment overseas?\",\n    \"Why is the exchange rate for my withdrawal wrong?\",\n    \"The ATM gave me a bad exchange rate\",\n    \"i got cash and the rate was wrong\",\n    \"the rate on my atm withdrawal was way off\",\n    \"Exchange rate on cash withdrawal incorrect\",\n    \"I withdrew cash abroad, the exchange rate was not right\",\n    \"my cash withdrawal had an incorrect exchange rate\",\n    \"Why was I charged more than expected for my cash withdrawal abroad? the rate is wrong\",\n    \"The exchange rate at the cash machine was terrible\",\n    \"Bad rate for cash withdrawal\",\n    \"what exchange rate was used for my cash withdrawal? it's wrong\",\n    \"I withdrew money and the exchange rate seems incorrect\",\n    \"the amount of my withdrawal in my currency is wrong, the rate must be off\",\n    \"wrong exchange rate for my atm cash\",\n    \"the conversion on my cash withdrawal is not right\",\n]\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EXDatKsTBc4umuzZPSgEMT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
